        "heading_RyTpxW": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Handcrafted Soy Candles with Long-Lasting Fragrance</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_kVtw8Y": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Discover our <strong>handmade soy candles in the UK</strong>, carefully poured in small batches in London to deliver a <strong>clean, even burn</strong> and a <strong>strong, long-lasting scent throw</strong>. Designed to gently fill your space without being overpowering, our candles are perfect for creating a warm, inviting atmosphere in any room.<br/></p><p>Our collection includes a wide range of fragrances to suit every mood and season. From <strong>warm and cosy scents</strong> like Pumpkin Spice and Cinnamon & Orange, to <strong>sweet bakery-inspired favourites</strong> like Strawberry Laces and Cherry Bakewell, and <strong>fresh, uplifting blends</strong> like Lavender and Lemongrass, there’s a fragrance for every home.</p><p>Each candle is made using <strong>high-quality soy wax</strong>, chosen for its clean-burning properties and ability to hold fragrance effectively. Whether you are looking for <strong>soy candles for relaxation</strong>, a <strong>thoughtful gift</strong>, or a signature scent for your home, Cozy Glow candles are designed to enhance everyday moments.</p><p><strong>Why choose Cozy Glow candles</strong><br/>✔ Handmade soy candles in London<br/>✔ Strong and consistent scent throw<br/>✔ Clean, even burn from start to finish<br/>✔ Ideal for gifting or relaxing at home</p><p><strong>Fast UK Delivery</strong><br/>All orders are dispatched quickly with <strong>tracked UK delivery</strong>, so you can enjoy your favourite scents without delay.</p><p>Explore the full collection of <strong>soy candles </strong>and discover a fragrance you will come back to again and again.</p>"
          }
        },
